      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Moderate field where BIDEN TIME (1) gets chance to atone. Fourth this course and distance two back then dropped back to 1200m latest and blew the start. Was always out of touch and finished at the tail. Back to a mile is worth another try in a modest line-up. MIAMI BABY (3) has been edging towards a win and looks the biggest danger. First try at the trip but going better than most and looks a leading chance. HELL AND BACK (2) proved too strong two runs ago at Katherine. Safely held last time out when eighth over 1300m at this track, beaten 8 lengths. Can bounce back on best figures. NEW ENTERPRISE (6) has a nice weight and can give a sight. DANGER MAN (5) next best.",
